{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>לך אזכרה בשם יהוה</b> — that people call to worship HaShem, in the manner of ויקרא שם בשם יהוה אל עולם (Genesis 21:33)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 116, :notes {0 "The lemma in the heading ('לך, בשם ה׳ אקרא') does not match Psalms 116:17; it appears to combine elements from different verses. Translated as given."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:52.739987016Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}